  "notes": "Text Input is a simple input field.\n\nNeeds daisyUI installed (npm i -D daisyui, then @plugin \"daisyui\" in your CSS).\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/saadeghi/daisyui/blob/master/packages/docs/src/routes/(routes)/components/input/+page.md",
  "code": "<label class=\"input validator\">\n  <svg class=\"h-[1em] opacity-50\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n    <g\n      stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n      stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n      stroke-width=\"2.5\"\n      fill=\"none\"\n      stroke=\"currentColor\"\n    >\n      <path\n        d=\"M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z\"\n      ></path>\n      <circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle>\n    </g>\n  </svg>\n  <input\n    type=\"password\"\n    required\n    placeholder=\"Password\"\n    minlength=\"8\"\n    pattern=\"(?=.*\\\\d)(?=.*[a-z])(?=.*[A-Z]).{8,}\"\n    title=\"Must be more than 8 characters, including number, lowercase letter, uppercase letter\"\n  />\n</label>\n<p class=\"validator-hint hidden\">\n  Must be more than 8 characters, including\n  <br />At least one number <br />At least one lowercase letter <br />At least one uppercase letter\n</p>",
